<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>BA × TWT · Piemonte Oct 2026 · Operaciones</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500&family=Fraunces:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/leaflet/1.9.4/leaflet.min.css">
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/leaflet/1.9.4/leaflet.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@supabase/supabase-js@2"></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/alpinejs@3.13.5/dist/cdn.min.js" defer></script>
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #f5efe5;
  --paper: #faf6ee;
  --paper-warm: #f1e9d8;
  --ink: #1c1410;
  --ink-soft: #4a3a30;
  --ink-mute: #8b7868;
  --ink-faint: #c4b5a3;
  --terracotta: #b8512e;
  --terracotta-soft: #d97851;
  --borgona: #6e1a1f;
  --borgona-deep: #3d0d11;
  --gold: #b8893a;
  --gold-soft: #d4a85a;
  --olive: #5a6b3a;
  --cream: #f0e6d2;
  --rule: rgba(28, 20, 16, 0.10);
  --rule-strong: rgba(28, 20, 16, 0.22);
  --rule-ink: #1c1410;
  --ok: #3c6b3c;
  --ok-bg: rgba(60, 107, 60, 0.08);
  --warn: #b8893a;
  --warn-bg: rgba(184, 137, 58, 0.10);
  --bad: #a82a1f;
  --bad-bg: rgba(168, 42, 31, 0.08);
  --info: #3a5a8b;
  --info-bg: rgba(58, 90, 139, 0.08);
  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px rgba(28,20,16,0.04);
  --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(28,20,16,0.04), 0 4px 12px rgba(28,20,16,0.06);
  --shadow-lg: 0 4px 8px rgba(28,20,16,0.06), 0 16px 32px rgba(28,20,16,0.10);
}

- { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

body {
background: var(–bg);
color: var(–ink);
font-family: ‘Inter’, system-ui, sans-serif;
font-size: 14px;
line-height: 1.5;
-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
min-height: 100vh;
background-image:
radial-gradient(circle at 15% 5%, rgba(184,81,46,0.04) 0%, transparent 40%),
radial-gradient(circle at 85% 95%, rgba(110,26,31,0.03) 0%, transparent 50%);
}

body::before {
content: ‘’;
position: fixed;
inset: 0;
pointer-events: none;
z-index: 1;
opacity: 0.35;
mix-blend-mode: multiply;
background-image: url(“data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 200 200'><filter id='n'><feTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.85' numOctaves='3'/><feColorMatrix values='0 0 0 0 0.11 0 0 0 0 0.08 0 0 0 0 0.06 0 0 0 0.06 0'/></filter><rect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/></svg>”);
}

/* === TYPOGRAPHY === */
.font-display { font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.015em; }
.font-serif { font-family: ‘Cormorant Garamond’, serif; }
.font-mono { font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace; letter-spacing: 0; }
.italic { font-style: italic; }

h1, h2, h3, h4 { font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.015em; line-height: 1.1; }

/* === LAYOUT === */
.app { position: relative; z-index: 2; min-height: 100vh; }

/* === HEADER === */
.app-header {
background: var(–paper);
border-bottom: 1px solid var(–rule-strong);
position: sticky;
top: 0;
z-index: 100;
backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
background: rgba(250, 246, 238, 0.94);
}
.header-top {
display: flex;
align-items: center;
justify-content: space-between;
padding: 16px 32px;
border-bottom: 1px solid var(–rule);
gap: 24px;
flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.brand {
display: flex;
align-items: baseline;
gap: 14px;
}
.brand-mark {
font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif;
font-size: 22px;
font-weight: 400;
letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}
.brand-mark em { font-style: italic; color: var(–borgona); }
.brand-mark::before {
content: ‘◆’;
color: var(–terracotta);
margin-right: 10px;
font-size: 10px;
vertical-align: 3px;
}
.brand-sub {
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 10px;
letter-spacing: 0.18em;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–ink-mute);
}

/* === IDENTITY MODAL === */
.identity-overlay {
position: fixed;
inset: 0;
background: rgba(28, 20, 16, 0.85);
backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
z-index: 2000;
display: flex;
align-items: center;
justify-content: center;
padding: 24px;
animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease;
}
@keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }

.identity-modal {
background: var(–paper);
padding: 48px 40px;
border-radius: 4px;
max-width: 480px;
width: 100%;
text-align: center;
box-shadow: var(–shadow-lg);
position: relative;
}
.identity-modal::before {
content: ‘◆’;
color: var(–terracotta);
font-size: 16px;
display: block;
margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.identity-modal h2 {
font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif;
font-size: 32px;
font-weight: 300;
margin-bottom: 12px;
letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}
.identity-modal h2 em { font-style: italic; color: var(–borgona); }
.identity-modal p {
font-family: ‘Cormorant Garamond’, serif;
font-size: 17px;
font-style: italic;
color: var(–ink-soft);
margin-bottom: 32px;
line-height: 1.5;
}
.identity-choices {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
gap: 12px;
}
.identity-btn {
font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif;
font-size: 22px;
font-weight: 400;
padding: 24px 16px;
background: white;
border: 1px solid var(–rule-strong);
border-radius: 4px;
cursor: pointer;
transition: all 0.2s;
letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}
.identity-btn:hover {
background: var(–ink);
color: var(–cream);
border-color: var(–ink);
transform: translateY(-2px);
box-shadow: var(–shadow);
}

/* === SYNC STATUS === */
.sync-status {
display: flex;
align-items: center;
gap: 16px;
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 10px;
letter-spacing: 0.12em;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–ink-mute);
flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.sync-pill {
display: inline-flex;
align-items: center;
gap: 6px;
}
.sync-dot {
width: 8px;
height: 8px;
border-radius: 50%;
display: inline-block;
}
.sync-dot.online { background: var(–ok); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(60, 107, 60, 0.15); }
.sync-dot.syncing { background: var(–warn); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(184, 137, 58, 0.15); animation: pulse 1s infinite; }
.sync-dot.offline { background: var(–bad); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(168, 42, 31, 0.15); }
.sync-dot.idle { background: var(–ink-mute); }
.who-am-i {
font-weight: 700;
color: var(–terracotta);
letter-spacing: 0.08em;
}
.last-edit {
font-family: ‘Cormorant Garamond’, serif;
font-size: 13px;
font-style: italic;
color: var(–ink-mute);
letter-spacing: 0;
text-transform: none;
}

/* === REMOTE EDIT TOAST === */
.toast.remote {
background: var(–borgona);
}
.toast.remote::before {
content: ‘◆’;
color: var(–gold-soft);
margin-right: 8px;
}

/* === STYLES === */
.save-indicator {
display: flex;
align-items: center;
gap: 16px;
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 11px;
letter-spacing: 0.1em;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–ink-mute);
}
.save-dot {
width: 8px;
height: 8px;
border-radius: 50%;
background: var(–ok);
display: inline-block;
margin-right: 8px;
vertical-align: 1px;
box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(60, 107, 60, 0.15);
transition: all 0.3s;
}
.save-dot.saving { background: var(–warn); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(184, 137, 58, 0.15); animation: pulse 1s infinite; }
@keyframes pulse {
0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
50% { opacity: 0.4; }
}

/* === TABS === */
.tabs {
display: flex;
padding: 0 32px;
gap: 0;
overflow-x: auto;
scrollbar-width: thin;
}
.tab {
font-family: ‘Inter’, sans-serif;
font-size: 13px;
font-weight: 500;
letter-spacing: 0.02em;
padding: 16px 0;
margin-right: 32px;
border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
background: none;
border-left: none;
border-right: none;
border-top: none;
color: var(–ink-mute);
cursor: pointer;
transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
white-space: nowrap;
display: flex;
align-items: center;
gap: 8px;
}
.tab:hover { color: var(–ink); }
.tab.active {
color: var(–terracotta);
border-bottom-color: var(–terracotta);
}
.tab-badge {
background: var(–rule-strong);
color: var(–ink);
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 10px;
padding: 2px 6px;
border-radius: 100px;
font-weight: 500;
}
.tab.active .tab-badge { background: var(–terracotta); color: var(–cream); }

/* === MAIN CONTAINER === */
main {
max-width: 1280px;
margin: 0 auto;
padding: 40px 32px 80px;
}

/* === SECTION HEADER === */
.section-header {
margin-bottom: 32px;
display: flex;
justify-content: space-between;
align-items: flex-start;
gap: 24px;
flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.section-header h1 {
font-size: 40px;
font-weight: 300;
}
.section-header h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(–borgona); }
.section-header .lead {
font-family: ‘Cormorant Garamond’, serif;
font-size: 18px;
font-style: italic;
color: var(–ink-soft);
margin-top: 8px;
max-width: 640px;
}

/* === CARDS === */
.card {
background: var(–paper);
border: 1px solid var(–rule);
padding: 24px;
border-radius: 4px;
box-shadow: var(–shadow-sm);
}
.card-tight { padding: 16px; }
.card-flush { padding: 0; }

/* === DASHBOARD === */
.dash-grid {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
gap: 24px;
margin-bottom: 32px;
}
@media (max-width: 880px) { .dash-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

.countdown-card {
background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(–borgona-deep), var(–borgona));
color: var(–cream);
padding: 40px;
border-radius: 4px;
position: relative;
overflow: hidden;
}
.countdown-card::before {
content: ‘’;
position: absolute;
inset: 0;
background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(212,168,90,0.15) 0%, transparent 50%);
pointer-events: none;
}
.countdown-label {
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 10px;
letter-spacing: 0.22em;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–gold-soft);
margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.countdown-value {
font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif;
font-weight: 300;
font-size: 96px;
line-height: 0.9;
letter-spacing: -0.04em;
}
.countdown-value small {
font-size: 28px;
color: rgba(240,230,210,0.6);
margin-left: 12px;
font-style: italic;
font-family: ‘Cormorant Garamond’, serif;
}
.countdown-detail {
font-family: ‘Cormorant Garamond’, serif;
font-style: italic;
font-size: 18px;
color: rgba(240,230,210,0.75);
margin-top: 24px;
line-height: 1.4;
}

.dash-stats {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
gap: 12px;
}
.stat-mini {
background: var(–paper);
border: 1px solid var(–rule);
padding: 18px;
border-radius: 4px;
}
.stat-mini-label {
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 9px;
letter-spacing: 0.18em;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–ink-mute);
margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.stat-mini-value {
font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif;
font-size: 28px;
font-weight: 400;
letter-spacing: -0.02em;
color: var(–ink);
}
.stat-mini-value small { font-size: 14px; color: var(–ink-mute); margin-left: 4px; font-family: ‘Cormorant Garamond’, serif; font-style: italic; }

.alert-block {
background: var(–paper);
border-left: 3px solid var(–bad);
padding: 20px 24px;
margin-bottom: 12px;
border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
}
.alert-block.warn { border-left-color: var(–warn); }
.alert-block.info { border-left-color: var(–info); }
.alert-block.ok { border-left-color: var(–ok); }
.alert-block-meta {
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 10px;
letter-spacing: 0.16em;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–bad);
margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.alert-block.warn .alert-block-meta { color: var(–warn); }
.alert-block.info .alert-block-meta { color: var(–info); }
.alert-block.ok .alert-block-meta { color: var(–ok); }
.alert-block-title {
font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif;
font-size: 18px;
font-weight: 500;
margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.alert-block-desc {
font-size: 13px;
color: var(–ink-soft);
line-height: 1.5;
}

/* === FORMS / INPUTS === */
input[type=“text”], input[type=“number”], input[type=“date”], input[type=“email”], input[type=“tel”], input[type=“url”], select, textarea {
font-family: ‘Inter’, sans-serif;
font-size: 14px;
color: var(–ink);
background: transparent;
border: 1px solid transparent;
border-bottom: 1px solid var(–rule);
padding: 6px 8px;
width: 100%;
border-radius: 2px;
transition: all 0.15s;
}
input[type=“text”]:hover, input[type=“number”]:hover, input[type=“email”]:hover, input[type=“tel”]:hover, input[type=“url”]:hover, select:hover, textarea:hover {
background: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
}
input[type=“text”]:focus, input[type=“number”]:focus, input[type=“date”]:focus, input[type=“email”]:focus, input[type=“tel”]:focus, input[type=“url”]:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus {
outline: none;
background: white;
border-color: var(–terracotta);
box-shadow: 0 1px 0 var(–terracotta);
}
textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 60px; line-height: 1.5; }
select { cursor: pointer; appearance: none; background-image: url(“data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 12 12'><path d='M3 5 L6 8 L9 5' stroke='%238b7868' stroke-width='1.5' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/></svg>”); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: right 4px center; padding-right: 24px; }

.input-inline {
border-bottom: 1px dashed transparent;
padding: 2px 4px;
}
.input-inline:hover { border-bottom-color: var(–ink-faint); }
.input-inline:focus { border-bottom: 1px solid var(–terracotta); }

label.field-label {
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 9px;
letter-spacing: 0.18em;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–ink-mute);
display: block;
margin-bottom: 4px;
}

/* === BUTTONS === */
.btn {
font-family: ‘Inter’, sans-serif;
font-size: 12px;
font-weight: 500;
letter-spacing: 0.02em;
padding: 8px 16px;
border: 1px solid var(–ink);
background: var(–ink);
color: var(–cream);
cursor: pointer;
transition: all 0.15s;
border-radius: 2px;
text-decoration: none;
display: inline-flex;
align-items: center;
gap: 8px;
}
.btn:hover { background: var(–borgona); border-color: var(–borgona); transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: var(–shadow); }
.btn-ghost {
background: transparent;
color: var(–ink);
border-color: var(–rule-strong);
}
.btn-ghost:hover { background: var(–paper-warm); color: var(–ink); border-color: var(–ink); transform: none; box-shadow: none; }
.btn-danger { background: var(–bad); border-color: var(–bad); }
.btn-danger:hover { background: #8b1f17; border-color: #8b1f17; }
.btn-sm { padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 11px; }
.btn-icon {
padding: 4px 8px;
background: transparent;
border: 1px solid transparent;
color: var(–ink-mute);
}
.btn-icon:hover { background: var(–paper-warm); color: var(–bad); border-color: var(–rule); transform: none; box-shadow: none; }

/* === ITINERARY === */
.day-card {
background: var(–paper);
border: 1px solid var(–rule);
margin-bottom: 24px;
border-radius: 4px;
overflow: hidden;
box-shadow: var(–shadow-sm);
}
.day-header {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr auto auto;
gap: 24px;
padding: 20px 24px;
border-bottom: 1px solid var(–rule);
align-items: center;
background: var(–paper-warm);
}
.day-number {
font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif;
font-size: 14px;
font-style: italic;
color: var(–terracotta);
letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}
.day-date-big {
font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif;
font-size: 32px;
font-weight: 300;
line-height: 1;
letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}
.day-date-big small {
display: block;
font-size: 12px;
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
color: var(–ink-mute);
letter-spacing: 0.1em;
text-transform: uppercase;
margin-top: 4px;
font-style: normal;
}
.day-title-input {
font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif;
font-size: 22px;
font-weight: 400;
letter-spacing: -0.01em;
border: none;
background: transparent;
border-bottom: 1px dashed transparent;
padding: 4px 0;
}
.day-title-input:hover { border-bottom-color: var(–ink-faint); }
.day-title-input:focus { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); border-bottom-color: var(–terracotta); outline: none; }

.status-pill {
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 10px;
letter-spacing: 0.14em;
text-transform: uppercase;
padding: 4px 10px;
border-radius: 100px;
font-weight: 500;
cursor: pointer;
border: 1px solid;
background: transparent;
}
.status-ok { background: var(–ok-bg); color: var(–ok); border-color: rgba(60, 107, 60, 0.3); }
.status-warn { background: var(–warn-bg); color: var(–warn); border-color: rgba(184, 137, 58, 0.3); }
.status-critical { background: var(–bad-bg); color: var(–bad); border-color: rgba(168, 42, 31, 0.3); }
.status-info { background: var(–info-bg); color: var(–info); border-color: rgba(58, 90, 139, 0.3); }

.slots-list { padding: 0; }
.slot {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr auto;
gap: 20px;
padding: 20px 24px;
border-bottom: 1px solid var(–rule);
align-items: start;
}
.slot:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.slot-time-input {
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 12px;
font-weight: 500;
color: var(–terracotta);
border: none;
background: transparent;
padding: 2px 4px;
border-bottom: 1px dashed transparent;
}
.slot-time-input:hover { border-bottom-color: var(–ink-faint); }
.slot-time-input:focus { outline: none; border-bottom-color: var(–terracotta); background: white; }

.slot-content { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
.slot-title-input {
font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif;
font-size: 17px;
font-weight: 500;
border: none;
background: transparent;
padding: 2px 4px;
border-bottom: 1px dashed transparent;
width: 100%;
}
.slot-title-input:hover { border-bottom-color: var(–ink-faint); }
.slot-title-input:focus { outline: none; border-bottom-color: var(–terracotta); background: white; }

.slot-desc-input {
font-size: 13px;
color: var(–ink-soft);
border: none;
background: transparent;
padding: 4px;
width: 100%;
border: 1px dashed transparent;
border-radius: 2px;
font-family: ‘Inter’, sans-serif;
}
.slot-desc-input:hover { border-color: var(–rule); }
.slot-desc-input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(–terracotta); background: white; }

.slot-actions { display: flex; gap: 4px; }

.add-slot-btn {
display: block;
width: 100%;
padding: 12px;
background: transparent;
border: 1px dashed var(–rule-strong);
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 11px;
letter-spacing: 0.14em;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–ink-mute);
cursor: pointer;
border-radius: 2px;
transition: all 0.15s;
}
.add-slot-btn:hover { border-color: var(–terracotta); color: var(–terracotta); background: var(–paper-warm); }

/* === BUDGET TABLE === */
.budget-table {
width: 100%;
background: var(–paper);
border: 1px solid var(–rule);
border-radius: 4px;
overflow: hidden;
box-shadow: var(–shadow-sm);
}
.budget-row {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: 32px 2fr 120px 2fr 100px 60px;
gap: 16px;
padding: 14px 20px;
align-items: center;
border-bottom: 1px solid var(–rule);
font-size: 14px;
}
.budget-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.budget-row.header {
background: var(–paper-warm);
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 10px;
letter-spacing: 0.16em;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–ink-mute);
font-weight: 500;
padding: 12px 20px;
}
.budget-row input { padding: 4px 6px; }
.budget-row .amount-input {
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
text-align: right;
font-weight: 500;
}

.budget-summary {
margin-top: 24px;
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
gap: 16px;
}
@media (max-width: 880px) { .budget-summary { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }

.summary-card {
background: var(–paper);
border: 1px solid var(–rule);
padding: 20px;
border-radius: 4px;
}
.summary-card.highlight { background: var(–ink); color: var(–cream); border-color: var(–ink); }
.summary-card-label {
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 9px;
letter-spacing: 0.2em;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–ink-mute);
margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.summary-card.highlight .summary-card-label { color: var(–gold-soft); }
.summary-card-value {
font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif;
font-size: 32px;
font-weight: 300;
letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}
.summary-card-value small {
font-size: 14px;
color: var(–ink-mute);
margin-left: 6px;
font-family: ‘Cormorant Garamond’, serif;
font-style: italic;
}
.summary-card.highlight .summary-card-value small { color: rgba(240,230,210,0.5); }

.bar-chart { margin-top: 32px; }
.bar-row {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr 100px;
gap: 16px;
align-items: center;
padding: 10px 0;
border-bottom: 1px solid var(–rule);
font-size: 13px;
}
.bar-row-label { font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif; font-size: 15px; }
.bar-track { background: var(–rule); height: 8px; border-radius: 100px; overflow: hidden; }
.bar-fill { height: 100%; background: var(–terracotta); border-radius: 100px; transition: width 0.4s; }
.bar-row-value { font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace; text-align: right; font-size: 12px; color: var(–ink-soft); }

/* === PROVIDERS === */
.providers-toolbar {
display: flex;
gap: 12px;
margin-bottom: 24px;
flex-wrap: wrap;
align-items: center;
}
.search-input {
flex: 1;
min-width: 200px;
background: var(–paper);
border: 1px solid var(–rule-strong);
border-bottom: 1px solid var(–rule-strong);
padding: 10px 14px;
border-radius: 4px;
font-size: 14px;
}
.search-input:focus { background: white; box-shadow: var(–shadow); }

.filter-chips { display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.chip {
font-family: ‘Inter’, sans-serif;
font-size: 12px;
font-weight: 500;
padding: 6px 12px;
background: var(–paper);
border: 1px solid var(–rule-strong);
color: var(–ink-soft);
border-radius: 100px;
cursor: pointer;
transition: all 0.15s;
}
.chip:hover { border-color: var(–ink); color: var(–ink); }
.chip.active { background: var(–ink); color: var(–cream); border-color: var(–ink); }

.providers-grid {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr));
gap: 16px;
}
.provider-card {
background: var(–paper);
border: 1px solid var(–rule);
padding: 20px;
border-radius: 4px;
box-shadow: var(–shadow-sm);
display: flex;
flex-direction: column;
gap: 8px;
transition: all 0.2s;
}
.provider-card:hover { box-shadow: var(–shadow); border-color: var(–rule-strong); }
.provider-card-head {
display: flex;
justify-content: space-between;
align-items: flex-start;
gap: 12px;
margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.provider-name {
font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif;
font-size: 19px;
font-weight: 500;
line-height: 1.2;
flex: 1;
}
.provider-name .stars { color: var(–gold); font-size: 14px; margin-left: 4px; vertical-align: 1px; }
.provider-type {
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 9px;
letter-spacing: 0.16em;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–ink-mute);
margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.provider-row {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: 90px 1fr;
gap: 8px;
font-size: 12px;
padding: 4px 0;
align-items: baseline;
}
.provider-row dt {
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 9px;
letter-spacing: 0.14em;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–ink-mute);
}
.provider-row dd {
font-size: 12.5px;
color: var(–ink-soft);
word-break: break-word;
}
.provider-row dd.danger { color: var(–bad); font-weight: 500; }
.provider-card-foot {
display: flex;
justify-content: space-between;
align-items: center;
margin-top: auto;
padding-top: 12px;
border-top: 1px solid var(–rule);
}

.res-status {
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 10px;
letter-spacing: 0.14em;
text-transform: uppercase;
padding: 4px 10px;
border-radius: 100px;
border: 1px solid;
background: transparent;
cursor: pointer;
}
.res-pending { color: var(–ink-mute); border-color: var(–rule-strong); }
.res-contacted { color: var(–info); border-color: rgba(58, 90, 139, 0.3); background: var(–info-bg); }
.res-confirmed { color: var(–ok); border-color: rgba(60, 107, 60, 0.3); background: var(–ok-bg); }
.res-cancelled { color: var(–bad); border-color: rgba(168, 42, 31, 0.3); background: var(–bad-bg); }

/* === ACTIONS === */
.action-item {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: 28px 60px 1fr 1fr 80px;
gap: 16px;
padding: 16px 20px;
background: var(–paper);
border: 1px solid var(–rule);
border-radius: 4px;
margin-bottom: 8px;
align-items: center;
transition: all 0.2s;
}
.action-item:hover { box-shadow: var(–shadow-sm); }
.action-item.done { opacity: 0.5; }
.action-item.done .action-title { text-decoration: line-through; }

.checkbox {
width: 20px;
height: 20px;
border: 1.5px solid var(–rule-strong);
border-radius: 4px;
cursor: pointer;
background: white;
display: flex;
align-items: center;
justify-content: center;
transition: all 0.15s;
}
.checkbox:hover { border-color: var(–ink); }
.checkbox.checked { background: var(–ok); border-color: var(–ok); }
.checkbox.checked::after {
content: ‘✓’;
color: white;
font-size: 13px;
font-weight: 700;
}

.priority-tag {
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 10px;
font-weight: 700;
letter-spacing: 0.04em;
padding: 4px 8px;
border-radius: 4px;
text-align: center;
background: var(–bad);
color: var(–cream);
}
.priority-tag.P2 { background: var(–warn); color: var(–ink); }
.priority-tag.P3 { background: var(–olive); color: var(–cream); }

.action-title {
font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif;
font-size: 16px;
font-weight: 500;
border: none;
background: transparent;
padding: 2px 4px;
}
.action-title:focus { outline: none; background: white; box-shadow: 0 1px 0 var(–terracotta); }

.action-desc {
font-size: 12px;
color: var(–ink-mute);
font-style: italic;
display: block;
margin-top: 2px;
}

.action-contact {
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 11px;
color: var(–ink-soft);
line-height: 1.5;
}

/* === BACKUP === */
.backup-grid {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
gap: 24px;
}
@media (max-width: 880px) { .backup-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

.backup-card {
background: var(–paper);
border: 1px solid var(–rule);
padding: 32px;
border-radius: 4px;
}
.backup-card h3 {
font-size: 24px;
margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.backup-card p {
font-family: ‘Cormorant Garamond’, serif;
font-style: italic;
color: var(–ink-soft);
margin-bottom: 20px;
font-size: 16px;
line-height: 1.5;
}
.backup-card.danger { border-color: rgba(168, 42, 31, 0.3); background: var(–bad-bg); }
.backup-card.danger h3 { color: var(–bad); }

.info-box {
background: var(–paper-warm);
border: 1px solid var(–rule);
padding: 20px 24px;
border-radius: 4px;
margin-top: 24px;
font-size: 13px;
line-height: 1.6;
color: var(–ink-soft);
}
.info-box code {
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
background: var(–ink);
color: var(–cream);
padding: 2px 6px;
border-radius: 2px;
font-size: 11px;
}

/* === EMPTY STATE === */
.empty-state {
padding: 64px 32px;
text-align: center;
color: var(–ink-mute);
font-family: ‘Cormorant Garamond’, serif;
font-style: italic;
font-size: 18px;
border: 1px dashed var(–rule-strong);
border-radius: 4px;
background: var(–paper);
}

/* === TOAST === */
.toast {
position: fixed;
bottom: 24px;
right: 24px;
background: var(–ink);
color: var(–cream);
padding: 12px 20px;
border-radius: 4px;
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 11px;
letter-spacing: 0.12em;
text-transform: uppercase;
z-index: 1000;
box-shadow: var(–shadow-lg);
animation: slideIn 0.3s ease;
}
@keyframes slideIn {
from { transform: translateY(20px); opacity: 0; }
to { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
}

/* === HISTORIAL / EVENT LOG === */
.event-row {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: 36px 1fr auto;
gap: 16px;
padding: 14px 20px;
background: var(–paper);
border: 1px solid var(–rule);
border-radius: 4px;
margin-bottom: 6px;
align-items: center;
transition: all 0.15s;
}
.event-row:hover { box-shadow: var(–shadow-sm); }
.event-avatar {
width: 32px;
height: 32px;
border-radius: 50%;
display: flex;
align-items: center;
justify-content: center;
font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif;
font-size: 14px;
font-weight: 500;
color: var(–cream);
}
.event-avatar.brian { background: var(–terracotta); }
.event-avatar.federico { background: var(–olive); }
.event-avatar.sistema { background: var(–ink-mute); }
.event-summary {
font-size: 14px;
line-height: 1.4;
}
.event-summary strong {
font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif;
font-weight: 500;
color: var(–ink);
}
.event-icon {
font-size: 14px;
margin-right: 4px;
}
.event-time {
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 10px;
letter-spacing: 0.1em;
color: var(–ink-mute);
text-transform: uppercase;
white-space: nowrap;
}
.event-filter-chips {
display: flex;
gap: 6px;
flex-wrap: wrap;
margin-bottom: 20px;
}

/* === SNAPSHOTS === */
.snapshot-item {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: 1fr auto auto;
gap: 12px;
padding: 14px 18px;
background: white;
border: 1px solid var(–rule);
border-radius: 4px;
margin-bottom: 6px;
align-items: center;
}
.snapshot-item strong {
font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif;
font-size: 16px;
display: block;
}
.snapshot-item small {
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 10px;
color: var(–ink-mute);
letter-spacing: 0.08em;
text-transform: uppercase;
}

/* === MENTIONS === */
.mention {
background: var(–gold-soft);
color: var(–borgona-deep);
padding: 1px 6px;
border-radius: 100px;
font-weight: 600;
font-size: 0.93em;
display: inline-block;
margin: 0 1px;
}
.mention-banner {
background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(–gold) 0%, var(–terracotta) 100%);
color: var(–cream);
padding: 12px 20px;
border-radius: 4px;
margin-bottom: 24px;
display: flex;
align-items: center;
justify-content: space-between;
gap: 16px;
box-shadow: var(–shadow);
animation: slideIn 0.4s ease;
}
.mention-banner-text {
font-family: ‘Cormorant Garamond’, serif;
font-style: italic;
font-size: 17px;
}
.mention-banner-text strong {
font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif;
font-weight: 600;
font-style: normal;
font-size: 18px;
}
.mention-banner button {
background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
color: var(–cream);
border: 1px solid rgba(240,230,210,0.4);
padding: 6px 14px;
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 11px;
letter-spacing: 0.12em;
text-transform: uppercase;
cursor: pointer;
border-radius: 4px;
}
.mention-banner button:hover { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.35); }

/* === MAP === */
.map-wrap {
border: 1px solid var(–rule);
border-radius: 4px;
overflow: hidden;
box-shadow: var(–shadow);
background: var(–paper);
}
#trip-map {
width: 100%;
height: 70vh;
min-height: 480px;
background: var(–paper-warm);
}
.map-legend {
display: flex;
flex-wrap: wrap;
gap: 12px;
padding: 16px 20px;
background: var(–paper);
border-top: 1px solid var(–rule);
font-size: 12px;
}
.map-legend-item {
display: inline-flex;
align-items: center;
gap: 6px;
cursor: pointer;
padding: 4px 10px;
border-radius: 100px;
border: 1px solid var(–rule-strong);
transition: all 0.15s;
font-family: ‘Inter’, sans-serif;
font-weight: 500;
}
.map-legend-item:hover { background: var(–paper-warm); }
.map-legend-item.disabled { opacity: 0.35; }
.map-legend-dot {
width: 12px;
height: 12px;
border-radius: 50%;
display: inline-block;
border: 2px solid white;
box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
}
/* Custom Leaflet pin styles */
.leaflet-pin {
display: flex;
align-items: center;
justify-content: center;
width: 28px;
height: 28px;
border-radius: 50% 50% 50% 0;
transform: rotate(-45deg);
border: 2px solid white;
box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 11px;
font-weight: 700;
color: white;
}
.leaflet-pin span { transform: rotate(45deg); }
.pin-villa { background: var(–borgona); width: 36px; height: 36px; font-size: 14px; }
.pin-restaurant { background: #b8512e; }
.pin-winery { background: #6e1a1f; }
.pin-truffle { background: #8b6914; }
.pin-activity { background: #3c6b3c; }
.pin-transfer { background: #5a6378; }
.pin-service { background: #3a5a8b; }
.leaflet-popup-content {
font-family: ‘Inter’, sans-serif;
margin: 12px 16px;
font-size: 13px;
}
.leaflet-popup-content strong {
font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif;
font-size: 16px;
font-weight: 500;
display: block;
margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.leaflet-popup-content .pop-type {
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 9px;
letter-spacing: 0.16em;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–ink-mute);
margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.leaflet-popup-content .pop-meta {
font-size: 12px;
color: var(–ink-soft);
margin-top: 4px;
}

/* === COMMENTS === */
.comments-toggle {
display: inline-flex;
align-items: center;
gap: 6px;
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 11px;
letter-spacing: 0.04em;
padding: 3px 10px;
background: var(–paper-warm);
border: 1px solid var(–rule);
border-radius: 100px;
cursor: pointer;
color: var(–ink-mute);
transition: all 0.15s;
}
.comments-toggle:hover { color: var(–terracotta); border-color: var(–terracotta); background: white; }
.comments-toggle.has-comments {
background: var(–info-bg);
border-color: rgba(58, 90, 139, 0.3);
color: var(–info);
}
.comments-toggle .count {
font-weight: 700;
}
.comments-panel {
margin-top: 12px;
padding: 16px;
background: var(–paper-warm);
border-left: 3px solid var(–info);
border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
}
.comment {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: 36px 1fr auto;
gap: 12px;
padding: 10px 0;
border-bottom: 1px dashed var(–rule);
align-items: start;
}
.comment:last-of-type { border-bottom: none; }
.comment-avatar {
width: 32px;
height: 32px;
border-radius: 50%;
background: var(–ink);
color: var(–cream);
display: flex;
align-items: center;
justify-content: center;
font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif;
font-size: 15px;
font-weight: 500;
}
.comment-avatar.brian { background: var(–terracotta); }
.comment-avatar.federico { background: var(–olive); }
.comment-body { min-width: 0; }
.comment-meta {
display: flex;
gap: 8px;
align-items: baseline;
margin-bottom: 4px;
font-size: 11px;
}
.comment-author {
font-family: ‘Fraunces’, serif;
font-weight: 600;
font-size: 14px;
color: var(–ink);
}
.comment-time {
font-family: ‘JetBrains Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 10px;
color: var(–ink-mute);
letter-spacing: 0.06em;
}
.comment-text {
font-size: 14px;
line-height: 1.5;
color: var(–ink-soft);
word-wrap: break-word;
}
.comment-actions {
display: flex;
gap: 4px;
}
.comment-form {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
gap: 8px;
margin-top: 12px;
padding-top: 12px;
border-top: 1px solid var(–rule);
}
.comment-input {
background: white;
border: 1px solid var(–rule-strong);
border-radius: 4px;
padding: 8px 12px;
font-size: 14px;
font-family: ‘Inter’, sans-serif;
}
.comment-input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(–terracotta); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(184,81,46,0.1); }

/* === MOBILE IMPROVEMENTS === */
@media (max-width: 880px) {
/* Bigger touch targets */
.btn { padding: 10px 18px; font-size: 13px; min-height: 40px; }
.btn-sm { padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 12px; }
.btn-icon { padding: 8px 12px; font-size: 16px; }
.tab { padding: 14px 0; min-height: 44px; }
.chip { padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 13px; min-height: 36px; }
.status-pill, .res-status, .priority-tag { padding: 6px 12px; min-height: 28px; }
.checkbox { width: 26px; height: 26px; }
.checkbox.checked::after { font-size: 16px; }
input, select, textarea { font-size: 16px !important; /* evita zoom iOS */ padding: 10px 12px; }
.slot-time-input, .day-title-input { font-size: 16px !important; }
/* Más espacio entre elementos */
.day-card { margin-bottom: 16px; }
.slot { padding: 16px; }
.provider-card { padding: 18px; }
.action-item { padding: 16px; }
/* Map full-screen on mobile */
#trip-map { height: 60vh; min-height: 380px; }
/* Comments mobile */
.comment { grid-template-columns: 32px 1fr; }
.comment-actions { grid-column: 2; justify-self: end; }
.comment-form { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
/* Tabs scrolling indicator */
.tabs { padding-bottom: 0; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
}
.header-top { padding: 12px 20px; }
.tabs { padding: 0 20px; }
main { padding: 24px 20px 48px; }
.day-header { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; }
.day-date-big { font-size: 24px; }
.day-title-input { grid-column: 1 / -1; font-size: 18px; }
.slot { grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr; gap: 12px; }
.slot-actions { grid-column: 1 / -1; justify-content: flex-end; }
.budget-row { grid-template-columns: 24px 1fr 80px 40px; gap: 8px; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 12px; }
.budget-row > *:nth-child(4), .budget-row > *:nth-child(5) { display: none; }
.action-item { grid-template-columns: 24px 50px 1fr; gap: 10px; padding: 12px; }
.action-item > *:nth-child(4), .action-item > *:nth-child(5) { grid-column: 1 / -1; padding-left: 84px; }
.countdown-card { padding: 28px; }
.countdown-value { font-size: 64px; }
.section-header h1 { font-size: 28px; }
}

/* Print */
@media print {
body::before, .app-header { display: none; }
main { padding: 20px; max-width: none; }
.card, .day-card, .budget-table, .provider-card, .action-item { box-shadow: none; border: 1px solid #ccc; }
}
</style>

</head>
<body>

<div class="app" x-data="app()" x-init="init()" x-cloak>

  <!-- ====== HEADER ====== -->

  <header class="app-header">
    <div class="header-top">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="brand-mark">BA × <em>TWT</em></div>
        <div class="brand-sub">Piemonte · Oct 2026 · Operaciones</div>
      </div>
      <div class="sync-status">
        <span class="sync-pill">
          <span class="sync-dot" :class="syncStatus"></span>
          <span x-text="syncLabel"></span>
        </span>
        <span class="who-am-i" x-show="identity" x-text="'Vos: ' + (identity || '')"></span>
        <span class="last-edit" x-show="lastUpdatedBy" x-text="'· última edición: ' + (lastUpdatedBy || '') + ' ' + relativeTime(lastUpdatedAt)"></span>
        <button class="btn-icon" @click="switchIdentity()" title="Cambiar identidad" style="font-size: 10px; padding: 2px 6px;">⇄</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav class="tabs">
      <button class="tab" :class="{ active: tab === 'dashboard' }" @click="tab = 'dashboard'">
        <span>Dashboard</span>
      </button>
      <button class="tab" :class="{ active: tab === 'itinerary' }" @click="tab = 'itinerary'">
        <span>Itinerario</span>
        <span class="tab-badge" x-text="data.itinerary.length"></span>
      </button>
      <button class="tab" :class="{ active: tab === 'budget' }" @click="tab = 'budget'">
        <span>Presupuesto</span>
      </button>
      <button class="tab" :class="{ active: tab === 'providers' }" @click="tab = 'providers'">
        <span>Proveedores</span>
        <span class="tab-badge" x-text="data.providers.length"></span>
      </button>
      <button class="tab" :class="{ active: tab === 'map' }" @click="tab = 'map'; $nextTick(() => initMap())">
        <span>Mapa</span>
      </button>
      <button class="tab" :class="{ active: tab === 'actions' }" @click="tab = 'actions'">
        <span>Reservas</span>
        <span class="tab-badge" x-text="data.actions.filter(a => !a.done).length"></span>
      </button>
      <button class="tab" :class="{ active: tab === 'history' }" @click="tab = 'history'; markHistorySeen()">
        <span>Historial</span>
        <span class="tab-badge" x-show="unseenChanges > 0" x-text="unseenChanges"></span>
      </button>
      <button class="tab" :class="{ active: tab === 'backup' }" @click="tab = 'backup'">
        <span>Backup</span>
      </button>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>

```
<!-- ====== MENTION BANNER ====== -->
<div class="mention-banner" x-show="unreadMentions.length > 0" x-cloak>
  <div class="mention-banner-text">
    <strong x-text="mentionBannerTitle"></strong>
    <span x-text="mentionBannerPreview"></span>
  </div>
  <button @click="markMentionsRead()">Marcar leídas</button>
</div>

<!-- ====== DASHBOARD ====== -->
<section x-show="tab === 'dashboard'">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div>
      <h1>Resumen <em>del viaje</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Vista general · alertas críticas · estado de reservas y presupuesto.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="dash-grid">
    <div class="countdown-card">
      <div class="countdown-label">Faltan para el viaje</div>
      <div class="countdown-value"><span x-text="daysUntilTrip"></span><small>días</small></div>
      <div class="countdown-detail" x-text="`Del ${formatDate(data.meta.startDate)} al ${formatDate(data.meta.endDate)} · ${data.meta.nights} noches · ${data.meta.pax} personas`"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-stats">
      <div class="stat-mini">
        <div class="stat-mini-label">Villa</div>
        <div class="stat-mini-value">€<span x-text="data.meta.villa.cost.toLocaleString('es')"></span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-mini">
        <div class="stat-mini-label">Costo total est.</div>
        <div class="stat-mini-value">€<span x-text="Math.round(budgetTotal/1000) + 'k'"></span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-mini">
        <div class="stat-mini-label">Ingreso bruto</div>
        <div class="stat-mini-value">$<span x-text="Math.round(data.meta.ticketUSD * data.meta.payingPax / 1000) + 'k'"></span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-mini">
        <div class="stat-mini-label">Margen bruto</div>
        <div class="stat-mini-value"><span x-text="marginPercent"></span>%</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; margin-top: 24px;">Alertas críticas</h2>
  <template x-for="alert in dashboardAlerts" :key="alert.id">
    <div class="alert-block" :class="alert.severity">
      <div class="alert-block-meta" x-text="alert.tag"></div>
      <div class="alert-block-title" x-text="alert.title"></div>
      <div class="alert-block-desc" x-text="alert.desc"></div>
    </div>
  </template>

  <h2 style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; margin-top: 40px;">Estado de reservas</h2>
  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 12px;">
    <div class="stat-mini">
      <div class="stat-mini-label">Confirmadas</div>
      <div class="stat-mini-value" style="color: var(--ok);" x-text="data.providers.filter(p => p.reservationStatus === 'confirmed').length"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-mini">
      <div class="stat-mini-label">Contactadas</div>
      <div class="stat-mini-value" style="color: var(--info);" x-text="data.providers.filter(p => p.reservationStatus === 'contacted').length"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-mini">
      <div class="stat-mini-label">Pendientes</div>
      <div class="stat-mini-value" style="color: var(--warn);" x-text="data.providers.filter(p => p.reservationStatus === 'pending').length"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-mini">
      <div class="stat-mini-label">Reservas hechas</div>
      <div class="stat-mini-value" x-text="data.actions.filter(a => a.done).length + '/' + data.actions.length"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ====== ITINERARIO ====== -->
<section x-show="tab === 'itinerary'">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div>
      <h1>Itinerario <em>día por día</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Hacé click en cualquier campo para editar. Cambios se guardan automáticamente.</p>
    </div>
    <button class="btn" @click="addDay()">+ Agregar día</button>
  </div>

  <template x-for="(day, dayIdx) in data.itinerary" :key="day.id">
    <article class="day-card">
      <header class="day-header">
        <div>
          <div class="day-number" x-text="`Día ${dayIdx + 1}`"></div>
          <div class="day-date-big">
            <input type="date" x-model="day.date" @blur="save()" style="border:none; font-family:Fraunces, serif; font-size: 24px; padding:0; background: transparent; width: 100%;">
            <small x-text="day.weekday"></small>
          </div>
        </div>
        <input type="text" class="day-title-input" x-model="day.title" @blur="save()" placeholder="Título del día...">
        <select class="status-pill" :class="'status-' + day.status" x-model="day.status" @change="save()">
          <option value="ok">Confirmado</option>
          <option value="warn">A revisar</option>
          <option value="critical">Problema</option>
          <option value="info">Info</option>
        </select>
        <button class="btn-icon" @click="deleteDay(dayIdx)" title="Eliminar día">✕</button>
      </header>

      <div class="slots-list">
        <template x-for="(slot, slotIdx) in day.slots" :key="slot.id">
          <div class="slot">
            <input type="text" class="slot-time-input" x-model="slot.time" @blur="save()" placeholder="hh:mm">
            <div class="slot-content">
              <input type="text" class="slot-title-input" x-model="slot.title" @blur="save()" placeholder="Actividad / lugar...">
              <textarea class="slot-desc-input" x-model="slot.description" @blur="save()" placeholder="Descripción, contacto, precio, notas..." rows="2"></textarea>
              <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; margin-top: 4px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                <select class="status-pill" :class="'status-' + slot.status" x-model="slot.status" @change="save()" style="flex: 0 0 auto;">
                  <option value="ok">OK</option>
                  <option value="warn">A revisar</option>
                  <option value="critical">Problema</option>
                  <option value="info">Info</option>
                </select>
                <input type="text" x-model="slot.verdict" @blur="save()" placeholder="Veredicto / acción..." style="font-size: 11px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; flex: 1; min-width: 140px;">
                <span class="comments-toggle" :class="{ 'has-comments': commentCount('slot', slot.id) > 0 }" @click="toggleComments('slot', slot.id)">
                  💬 <span class="count" x-text="commentCount('slot', slot.id) || '+'"></span>
                </span>
              </div>
              <div class="comments-panel" x-show="openComments === 'slot:' + slot.id" x-cloak>
                <template x-for="c in commentsFor('slot', slot.id)" :key="c.id">
                  <div class="comment">
                    <div class="comment-avatar" :class="(c.author || '').toLowerCase()" x-text="(c.author || '?').substring(0,1)"></div>
                    <div class="comment-body">
                      <div class="comment-meta">
                        <span class="comment-author" x-text="c.author"></span>
                        <span class="comment-time" x-text="relativeTime(c.created_at)"></span>
                      </div>
                      <div class="comment-text" x-html="formatCommentText(c.text)"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="comment-actions">
                      <button class="btn-icon" x-show="c.author === identity" @click="deleteComment(c.id)" title="Borrar">✕</button>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </template>
                <div x-show="commentsFor('slot', slot.id).length === 0" style="font-size: 13px; font-style: italic; color: var(--ink-mute); padding: 8px 0;">
                  Sin comentarios aún. Iniciá el thread.
                </div>
                <form class="comment-form" @submit.prevent="addComment('slot', slot.id, $event)">
                  <input type="text" class="comment-input" name="text" placeholder="Comentario..." maxlength="500">
                  <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm">Enviar</button>
                </form>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="slot-actions">
              <button class="btn-icon" @click="deleteSlot(dayIdx, slotIdx)" title="Eliminar slot">✕</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </template>
        <div style="padding: 12px 24px;">
          <button class="add-slot-btn" @click="addSlot(dayIdx)">+ Agregar slot</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </template>

  <template x-if="data.itinerary.length === 0">
    <div class="empty-state">No hay días en el itinerario. <button class="btn" @click="addDay()" style="margin-left: 12px;">+ Agregar primer día</button></div>
  </template>
</section>

<!-- ====== PRESUPUESTO ====== -->
<section x-show="tab === 'budget'">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div>
      <h1>Presupuesto <em>operativo</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Costos bottom-up. Totales y margen calculados automáticamente.</p>
    </div>
    <button class="btn" @click="addBudgetItem()">+ Agregar línea</button>
  </div>

  <div class="budget-table">
    <div class="budget-row header">
      <div></div>
      <div>Categoría</div>
      <div style="text-align:right;">Monto €</div>
      <div>Notas</div>
      <div style="text-align:center;">Estado</div>
      <div></div>
    </div>
    <template x-for="(item, idx) in data.budget" :key="item.id">
      <div class="budget-row">
        <div class="font-mono" style="font-size: 10px; color: var(--ink-mute);" x-text="String(idx+1).padStart(2,'0')"></div>
        <input type="text" x-model="item.category" @blur="save()" placeholder="Categoría">
        <input type="number" class="amount-input" x-model.number="item.amount" @blur="save()" placeholder="0">
        <input type="text" x-model="item.notes" @blur="save()" placeholder="Notas...">
        <select x-model="item.status" @change="save()" style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; text-align: center;">
          <option value="paid">Pagado</option>
          <option value="confirmed">Confirmado</option>
          <option value="estimated">Estimado</option>
          <option value="pending">Pendiente</option>
        </select>
        <button class="btn-icon" @click="data.budget.splice(idx, 1); save()" title="Eliminar">✕</button>
      </div>
    </template>
  </div>

  <div class="budget-summary">
    <div class="summary-card">
      <div class="summary-card-label">Costo total</div>
      <div class="summary-card-value">€<span x-text="budgetTotal.toLocaleString('es')"></span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="summary-card">
      <div class="summary-card-label">Costo por pax</div>
      <div class="summary-card-value">€<span x-text="Math.round(budgetTotal / data.meta.pax).toLocaleString('es')"></span><small>×<span x-text="data.meta.pax"></span></small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="summary-card">
      <div class="summary-card-label">Ingreso bruto</div>
      <div class="summary-card-value">$<span x-text="(data.meta.ticketUSD * data.meta.payingPax).toLocaleString('es')"></span><small>USD</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="summary-card highlight">
      <div class="summary-card-label">Margen bruto</div>
      <div class="summary-card-value"><span x-text="marginPercent"></span>%<small>€<span x-text="marginEUR.toLocaleString('es')"></span></small></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="margin-top: 32px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px;">Distribución de costos</h3>
    <div class="bar-chart">
      <template x-for="item in budgetSorted" :key="item.id">
        <div class="bar-row" x-show="item.amount > 0">
          <div class="bar-row-label" x-text="item.category"></div>
          <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" :style="`width: ${(item.amount / budgetTotal * 100).toFixed(0)}%`"></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row-value">€<span x-text="item.amount.toLocaleString('es')"></span> · <span x-text="(item.amount / budgetTotal * 100).toFixed(0)"></span>%</div>
        </div>
      </template>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="margin-top: 24px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px;">Parámetros</h3>
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 16px;">
      <div>
        <label class="field-label">Pax totales</label>
        <input type="number" x-model.number="data.meta.pax" @blur="save()">
      </div>
      <div>
        <label class="field-label">Pax pagantes</label>
        <input type="number" x-model.number="data.meta.payingPax" @blur="save()">
      </div>
      <div>
        <label class="field-label">Ticket USD</label>
        <input type="number" x-model.number="data.meta.ticketUSD" @blur="save()">
      </div>
      <div>
        <label class="field-label">Tipo cambio EUR→USD</label>
        <input type="number" step="0.01" x-model.number="data.meta.eurUsdRate" @blur="save()">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ====== PROVEEDORES ====== -->
<section x-show="tab === 'providers'">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div>
      <h1>Directorio de <em>proveedores</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Restaurantes, bodegas, truffle hunt, transfers, servicios. Click en estado para cambiarlo.</p>
    </div>
    <button class="btn" @click="addProvider()">+ Agregar proveedor</button>
  </div>

  <div class="providers-toolbar">
    <input type="text" class="search-input" x-model="providerSearch" placeholder="Buscar proveedor por nombre, lugar o contacto...">
  </div>

  <div class="filter-chips" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
    <button class="chip" :class="{ active: providerFilter === 'all' }" @click="providerFilter = 'all'">Todos (<span x-text="data.providers.length"></span>)</button>
    <template x-for="type in providerTypes" :key="type.key">
      <button class="chip" :class="{ active: providerFilter === type.key }" @click="providerFilter = type.key">
        <span x-text="type.label"></span> (<span x-text="data.providers.filter(p => p.type === type.key).length"></span>)
      </button>
    </template>
  </div>

  <div class="providers-grid">
    <template x-for="provider in filteredProviders" :key="provider.id">
      <div class="provider-card">
        <div class="provider-card-head">
          <div style="flex:1;">
            <div class="provider-type" x-text="(providerTypes.find(t => t.key === provider.type) || {label: provider.type}).label"></div>
            <input type="text" class="provider-name" x-model="provider.name" @blur="save()" style="border:none; background:transparent; padding:0; width:100%;">
          </div>
          <button class="btn-icon" @click="deleteProvider(provider.id)" title="Eliminar">✕</button>
        </div>
        <dl style="margin: 4px 0;">
          <div class="provider-row" x-show="provider.michelin > 0">
            <dt>Michelin</dt>
            <dd style="color: var(--gold);"><span x-text="'★'.repeat(provider.michelin)"></span></dd>
          </div>
          <div class="provider-row">
            <dt>Lugar</dt>
            <dd><input type="text" x-model="provider.location" @blur="save()" placeholder="ciudad/pueblo"></dd>
          </div>
          <div class="provider-row">
            <dt>Tel</dt>
            <dd><input type="tel" x-model="provider.phone" @blur="save()" placeholder="+39..."></dd>
          </div>
          <div class="provider-row">
            <dt>Email</dt>
            <dd><input type="email" x-model="provider.email" @blur="save()" placeholder="email@..."></dd>
          </div>
          <div class="provider-row">
            <dt>Web</dt>
            <dd><input type="text" x-model="provider.web" @blur="save()" placeholder="dominio.com"></dd>
          </div>
          <div class="provider-row">
            <dt>Precio</dt>
            <dd><input type="text" x-model="provider.priceRange" @blur="save()" placeholder="€..."></dd>
          </div>
          <div class="provider-row" x-show="provider.closingDays">
            <dt>Cierre</dt>
            <dd :class="{ danger: provider.closingDays }"><input type="text" x-model="provider.closingDays" @blur="save()" placeholder="Lun, Mar..."></dd>
          </div>
          <div class="provider-row">
            <dt>Notas</dt>
            <dd><textarea x-model="provider.notes" @blur="save()" rows="2" placeholder="..."></textarea></dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
        <div class="provider-card-foot">
          <select class="res-status" :class="'res-' + provider.reservationStatus" x-model="provider.reservationStatus" @change="save()">
            <option value="pending">Pendiente</option>
            <option value="contacted">Contactado</option>
            <option value="confirmed">Confirmado</option>
            <option value="cancelled">Cancelado</option>
          </select>
          <select x-model="provider.type" @change="save()" style="font-size: 10px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; color: var(--ink-mute);">
            <template x-for="type in providerTypes" :key="type.key">
              <option :value="type.key" x-text="type.label"></option>
            </template>
          </select>
        </div>
        <span class="comments-toggle" :class="{ 'has-comments': commentCount('provider', provider.id) > 0 }" @click="toggleComments('provider', provider.id)" style="align-self: flex-start; margin-top: 8px;">
          💬 <span class="count" x-text="commentCount('provider', provider.id) || '+'"></span> comentarios
        </span>
        <div class="comments-panel" x-show="openComments === 'provider:' + provider.id" x-cloak>
          <template x-for="c in commentsFor('provider', provider.id)" :key="c.id">
            <div class="comment">
              <div class="comment-avatar" :class="(c.author || '').toLowerCase()" x-text="(c.author || '?').substring(0,1)"></div>
              <div class="comment-body">
                <div class="comment-meta">
                  <span class="comment-author" x-text="c.author"></span>
                  <span class="comment-time" x-text="relativeTime(c.created_at)"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="comment-text" x-html="formatCommentText(c.text)"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="comment-actions">
                <button class="btn-icon" x-show="c.author === identity" @click="deleteComment(c.id)" title="Borrar">✕</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </template>
          <div x-show="commentsFor('provider', provider.id).length === 0" style="font-size: 13px; font-style: italic; color: var(--ink-mute); padding: 8px 0;">
            Sin comentarios aún.
          </div>
          <form class="comment-form" @submit.prevent="addComment('provider', provider.id, $event)">
            <input type="text" class="comment-input" name="text" placeholder="Comentario..." maxlength="500">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm">Enviar</button>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </template>
  </div>

  <template x-if="filteredProviders.length === 0">
    <div class="empty-state">Sin resultados. Cambiá filtros o <button class="btn btn-sm" @click="addProvider()" style="margin-left: 8px;">+ agregá un proveedor</button></div>
  </template>
</section>

<!-- ====== MAPA ====== -->
<section x-show="tab === 'map'">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div>
      <h1>Mapa del <em>viaje</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Villa, proveedores y lugares del itinerario. Click en cada pin para ver detalles.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="map-wrap">
    <div id="trip-map"></div>
    <div class="map-legend">
      <span class="map-legend-item" @click="toggleMapLayer('villa')" :class="{ disabled: !mapLayers.villa }">
        <span class="map-legend-dot" style="background: #6e1a1f;"></span> Villa
      </span>
      <span class="map-legend-item" @click="toggleMapLayer('restaurant')" :class="{ disabled: !mapLayers.restaurant }">
        <span class="map-legend-dot" style="background: #b8512e;"></span> Restaurantes
      </span>
      <span class="map-legend-item" @click="toggleMapLayer('winery')" :class="{ disabled: !mapLayers.winery }">
        <span class="map-legend-dot" style="background: #6e1a1f;"></span> Bodegas
      </span>
      <span class="map-legend-item" @click="toggleMapLayer('truffle')" :class="{ disabled: !mapLayers.truffle }">
        <span class="map-legend-dot" style="background: #8b6914;"></span> Truffle hunt
      </span>
      <span class="map-legend-item" @click="toggleMapLayer('activity')" :class="{ disabled: !mapLayers.activity }">
        <span class="map-legend-dot" style="background: #3c6b3c;"></span> Experiencias
      </span>
      <span class="map-legend-item" @click="toggleMapLayer('transfer')" :class="{ disabled: !mapLayers.transfer }">
        <span class="map-legend-dot" style="background: #5a6378;"></span> Transfers
      </span>
      <span class="map-legend-item" @click="toggleMapLayer('service')" :class="{ disabled: !mapLayers.service }">
        <span class="map-legend-dot" style="background: #3a5a8b;"></span> Servicios
      </span>
      <span class="map-legend-item" @click="toggleDayRoutes()" :class="{ disabled: !showDayRoutes }" style="border-color: var(--terracotta); color: var(--terracotta);">
        <span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px;">— — —</span> Rutas por día
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="margin-top: 16px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-mute); font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;">
    <span x-text="mappedProvidersCount"></span> proveedores ubicados · datos OpenStreetMap
  </p>
</section>

<!-- ====== RESERVAS / ACTIONS ====== -->
<section x-show="tab === 'actions'">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div>
      <h1>Reservas <em>pendientes</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Checklist priorizado. Click en el círculo para marcar como hecho.</p>
    </div>
    <button class="btn" @click="addAction()">+ Agregar tarea</button>
  </div>

  <div class="filter-chips" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
    <button class="chip" :class="{ active: actionFilter === 'all' }" @click="actionFilter = 'all'">Todas (<span x-text="data.actions.length"></span>)</button>
    <button class="chip" :class="{ active: actionFilter === 'pending' }" @click="actionFilter = 'pending'">Pendientes (<span x-text="data.actions.filter(a => !a.done).length"></span>)</button>
    <button class="chip" :class="{ active: actionFilter === 'done' }" @click="actionFilter = 'done'">Hechas (<span x-text="data.actions.filter(a => a.done).length"></span>)</button>
    <button class="chip" :class="{ active: actionFilter === 'P1' }" @click="actionFilter = 'P1'">P1 (<span x-text="data.actions.filter(a => a.priority === 'P1').length"></span>)</button>
    <button class="chip" :class="{ active: actionFilter === 'P2' }" @click="actionFilter = 'P2'">P2 (<span x-text="data.actions.filter(a => a.priority === 'P2').length"></span>)</button>
    <button class="chip" :class="{ active: actionFilter === 'P3' }" @click="actionFilter = 'P3'">P3 (<span x-text="data.actions.filter(a => a.priority === 'P3').length"></span>)</button>
  </div>

  <template x-for="action in filteredActions" :key="action.id">
    <div>
      <div class="action-item" :class="{ done: action.done }">
        <div class="checkbox" :class="{ checked: action.done }" @click="action.done = !action.done; save()"></div>
        <select class="priority-tag" :class="action.priority" x-model="action.priority" @change="save()" style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; appearance: none; background-image: none; padding: 4px 8px;">
          <option value="P1">P1</option>
          <option value="P2">P2</option>
          <option value="P3">P3</option>
        </select>
        <div>
          <input type="text" class="action-title" x-model="action.task" @blur="save()" style="width:100%;">
          <input type="text" x-model="action.description" @blur="save()" class="action-desc" style="border:none; background:transparent; padding:0; width:100%;" placeholder="Detalles...">
        </div>
        <div class="action-contact">
          <input type="text" x-model="action.contact" @blur="save()" placeholder="Contacto / web..." style="font-size: 11px;">
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 4px; align-items: center;">
          <span class="comments-toggle" :class="{ 'has-comments': commentCount('action', action.id) > 0 }" @click="toggleComments('action', action.id)" title="Comentarios">
            💬 <span class="count" x-text="commentCount('action', action.id) || '+'"></span>
          </span>
          <button class="btn-icon" @click="data.actions = data.actions.filter(a => a.id !== action.id); save()" title="Eliminar">✕</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="comments-panel" x-show="openComments === 'action:' + action.id" x-cloak style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
        <template x-for="c in commentsFor('action', action.id)" :key="c.id">
          <div class="comment">
            <div class="comment-avatar" :class="(c.author || '').toLowerCase()" x-text="(c.author || '?').substring(0,1)"></div>
            <div class="comment-body">
              <div class="comment-meta">
                <span class="comment-author" x-text="c.author"></span>
                <span class="comment-time" x-text="relativeTime(c.created_at)"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="comment-text" x-html="formatCommentText(c.text)"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="comment-actions">
              <button class="btn-icon" x-show="c.author === identity" @click="deleteComment(c.id)" title="Borrar">✕</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </template>
        <div x-show="commentsFor('action', action.id).length === 0" style="font-size: 13px; font-style: italic; color: var(--ink-mute); padding: 8px 0;">
          Sin comentarios aún.
        </div>
        <form class="comment-form" @submit.prevent="addComment('action', action.id, $event)">
          <input type="text" class="comment-input" name="text" placeholder="Comentario..." maxlength="500">
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm">Enviar</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </template>
</section>

<!-- ====== HISTORIAL ====== -->
<section x-show="tab === 'history'">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div>
      <h1>Historial <em>de cambios</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Bitácora de todas las acciones: quién hizo qué y cuándo. Útil para auditar y volver atrás.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="event-filter-chips">
    <button class="chip" :class="{ active: historyFilter === 'all' }" @click="historyFilter = 'all'">Todo (<span x-text="changes.length"></span>)</button>
    <button class="chip" :class="{ active: historyFilter === 'Brian' }" @click="historyFilter = 'Brian'">Brian (<span x-text="changes.filter(c => c.author === 'Brian').length"></span>)</button>
    <button class="chip" :class="{ active: historyFilter === 'Federico' }" @click="historyFilter = 'Federico'">Federico (<span x-text="changes.filter(c => c.author === 'Federico').length"></span>)</button>
    <button class="chip" :class="{ active: historyFilter === 'comments' }" @click="historyFilter = 'comments'">Comentarios</button>
    <button class="chip" :class="{ active: historyFilter === 'edits' }" @click="historyFilter = 'edits'">Ediciones</button>
  </div>

  <template x-for="c in filteredChanges" :key="c.id">
    <div class="event-row">
      <div class="event-avatar" :class="(c.author || '').toLowerCase()" x-text="(c.author || '?').substring(0,1)"></div>
      <div class="event-summary">
        <span class="event-icon" x-text="eventIcon(c.event_type)"></span>
        <strong x-text="c.author"></strong> <span x-text="c.summary"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="event-time" x-text="relativeTime(c.created_at)"></div>
    </div>
  </template>

  <template x-if="filteredChanges.length === 0">
    <div class="empty-state">
      <span x-show="changes.length === 0">Aún no hay eventos registrados.<br>Las acciones futuras (agregar/eliminar/cambiar estado, comentarios, snapshots) van a aparecer acá.</span>
      <span x-show="changes.length > 0">Sin resultados con este filtro.</span>
    </div>
  </template>
</section>

<!-- ====== BACKUP ====== -->
<section x-show="tab === 'backup'">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div>
      <h1>Backup y <em>configuración</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Tus datos viven en localStorage (este navegador). Exportá JSON para respaldar o moverte de dispositivo.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="backup-grid">
    <div class="backup-card">
      <h3>Exportar datos</h3>
      <p>Descargá un archivo .json con toda tu información: itinerario, presupuesto, proveedores y tareas. Servís el archivo para backup o para mover los datos a otro navegador/dispositivo.</p>
      <button class="btn" @click="exportData()">↓ Descargar JSON</button>
    </div>

    <div class="backup-card">
      <h3>Importar datos</h3>
      <p>Subí un archivo .json previamente exportado. Reemplaza todos los datos actuales — exportá antes si querés conservarlos.</p>
      <label class="btn btn-ghost" style="cursor: pointer;">
        ↑ Subir archivo JSON
        <input type="file" accept=".json,application/json" @change="importData($event)" style="display: none;">
      </label>
    </div>

    <div class="backup-card">
      <h3>Imprimir / PDF</h3>
      <p>Generá una versión imprimible del itinerario completo. Cmd/Ctrl + P → Guardar como PDF.</p>
      <button class="btn btn-ghost" @click="window.print()">⎙ Imprimir</button>
    </div>

    <div class="backup-card">
      <h3>Exportar a calendario</h3>
      <p>Descargá el itinerario como archivo <code style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; background: var(--ink); color: var(--cream); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 2px;">.ics</code> e importalo en Google Calendar, Apple Calendar u Outlook. Cada slot se convierte en un evento con horario y descripción.</p>
      <button class="btn btn-ghost" @click="exportICal()">📅 Descargar .ics</button>
    </div>

    <div class="backup-card" style="grid-column: 1 / -1;">
      <h3>Versiones / snapshots</h3>
      <p>Guardá un snapshot nombrado del estado actual antes de cambios grandes. Podés restaurarlo después si te arrepentís. Snapshots compartidos entre Brian y Federico.</p>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <input type="text" x-model="newSnapshotName" placeholder="Nombre (ej: 'antes de mover día 3')" style="flex: 1; min-width: 200px; padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); border-radius: 4px;">
        <button class="btn" @click="saveSnapshot()" :disabled="!newSnapshotName.trim()">💾 Guardar versión</button>
      </div>
      <template x-for="s in snapshots" :key="s.id">
        <div class="snapshot-item">
          <div>
            <strong x-text="s.name"></strong>
            <small><span x-text="s.author"></span> · <span x-text="relativeTime(s.created_at)"></span> · <span x-text="formatFullDate(s.created_at)"></span></small>
          </div>
          <button class="btn btn-sm btn-ghost" @click="restoreSnapshot(s)">↺ Restaurar</button>
          <button class="btn-icon" @click="deleteSnapshot(s.id)" title="Eliminar">✕</button>
        </div>
      </template>
      <template x-if="snapshots.length === 0">
        <div style="font-style: italic; color: var(--ink-mute); font-size: 14px; padding: 12px 0;">No hay snapshots aún. Guardá uno antes de hacer cambios grandes.</div>
      </template>
    </div>

    <div class="backup-card danger">
      <h3>Reset completo</h3>
      <p>Borrar todos los datos y volver al estado inicial pre-cargado (datos del fact-check). Asegurate de exportar antes si tenés algo que guardar.</p>
      <button class="btn btn-danger" @click="resetAllData()">⌫ Reset</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="info-box">
    <strong style="font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 16px; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px;">Cómo deployar a Netlify</strong>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Opción A (más simple, 30 segundos):</strong> Ir a <code>https://app.netlify.com/drop</code>, arrastrar este archivo HTML, y listo. Tenés URL al instante.</p>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Opción B (con tu GitHub, auto-deploy):</strong> Subir el archivo a un repo (ej. <code>git add . &amp;&amp; git commit -m "init" &amp;&amp; git push</code>), entrar a <code>app.netlify.com</code>, conectar el repo, y cada push deploya solo.</p>
    <p><strong>Importante sobre los datos:</strong> el auto-save usa <code>localStorage</code>, que vive en cada navegador por separado. Si querés sincronizar entre dispositivos, exportá JSON desde uno e importalo en el otro.</p>
  </div>
</section>
```

  </main>

  <!-- Toast -->

  <div class="toast" :class="{ remote: toastRemote }" x-show="showToast" x-transition x-text="toastMessage"></div>

  <!-- Identity Modal -->

  <div class="identity-overlay" x-show="!identity" x-cloak>
    <div class="identity-modal">
      <h2>¿Quién <em>sos</em>?</h2>
      <p>Elegí tu identidad para esta sesión. Aparecerá junto a cada edición y permite saber quién cambió qué.</p>
      <div class="identity-choices">
        <button class="identity-btn" @click="setIdentity('Brian')">Brian</button>
        <button class="identity-btn" @click="setIdentity('Federico')">Federico</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

